{"id":"525e9ee4487a8fee","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-jonsson.md","title":"Jónsson Cardinal","display":"thm-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-jonsson","aliases":["58-thm-jonsson"],"display":"thm-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-jonsson]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-jonsson"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-jonsson</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6b9b6494187f1b0\" href=\"?note=a6b9b6494187f1b0\" title=\"58-df-jonsson\">58-df-jonsson</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6b9b6494187f1b0\" href=\"?note=a6b9b6494187f1b0\" title=\"58-df-jonsson\">58-df-jonsson</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\n\\land\nf[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}]\\neq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\n\\land\nf[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}]\\neq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, a Jónsson cardinal satisfies the positive partition relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\to[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\kappa\\to[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}_{\\kappa}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_{\\omega}\">\\(\\aleph_{\\omega}\\)</span> is Jónsson under certain assumptions.</li>\n<li>Cardinality and infinitude are explicit on the partition-relation side, so the biconditional has the same domain as the upstream Jónsson predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-jonsson","status":"resolved","id":"a6b9b6494187f1b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-jonsson]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-jonsson","status":"resolved","id":"a6b9b6494187f1b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-jonsson]] and [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-jonsson]] and [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{<\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|H|=\\kappa\n\\land\nf[[H]^{<\\omega}]\\neq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa\\to[\\kappa]^{<\\omega}_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_{\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1166,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-jonsson.md|58-thm-jonsson]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a6b9b6494187f1b0","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751"]}